{
  "title": "The Meshy chibis in the game: Eric, Mio and Kuro (try it with ?chibi=1)",
  "date": "2026-10-03",
  "by": "claude-agent:chibi-ingame",
  "caption": "From your note: \"Try getting the meshy ones in game\". eric-1, mio-3 and kuro-1 from chibi-cast-meshy-1 now replace Eric, Mio and Kuro wherever they appear, when you add ?chibi=1 to the address or turn on Settings > Graphics > Chibi cast (it applies the next time the game loads). It's off by default, so nothing changes until you decide. They are the same heights as the bodies they replace and use the game's walk, run, idle, sit and phone pose, plus Eric's bow, wave, shrug and nod. The glasses are the modelled frames. Desktop uses a 20k-triangle copy of each and phones an 8k one, each with a 1024 px texture baked from the full model. Close-ups were taken with the camera moved in front of them.",
